<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Structured JSON-LD Schema Graph -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(pageSchema)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO / OPENING ------------------------------------------------>
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Mobile Car Repair Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Dubai-Wide Mobile Coverage · On-Site Mechanic Assistance · Al Satwa Workshop Support</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Mobile Car Repair Dubai – On-Site Mechanic Comes to You
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Need a reliable mobile mechanic in Dubai? Dubai Car Repair Service provides professional mobile car repair across all areas of Dubai, bringing vehicle assistance directly to your home, workplace, parking area or a suitable roadside location. From battery replacement and jump starts to computer diagnostics, tyre assistance, oil changes and supported mechanical repairs, our technicians help you deal with vehicle problems without having to drive to a garage. For more extensive mechanical work, our Al Satwa workshop is also available. Call or WhatsApp us to arrange mobile car repair at your location, with fast and affordable pricing.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-highlights">
                    <span class="dcrs-hero-highlight"><Fragment set:html={icons.check} /> Mobile Car Repair Across Dubai</span>
                    <span class="dcrs-hero-highlight"><Fragment set:html={icons.check} /> On-Site Mechanic Assistance</span>
                    <span class="dcrs-hero-highlight"><Fragment set:html={icons.check} /> Battery, Diagnostics &amp; Jump Starts</span>
                    <span class="dcrs-hero-highlight"><Fragment set:html={icons.check} /> Central Call-Out from AED 30</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. SERVICE OVERVIEW ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="service-overview">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-grid-2col dcrs-grid-2col--align-center">
                    <div class="dcrs-intro-content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Service Overview</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Mobile Car Repair Dubai - Practical On-Site Mechanical Help
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-lead-text">
                            When your car experiences a sudden breakdown, starting trouble, or an unexpected warning light, driving to a garage may be impossible or unsafe. Dubai Car Repair Service provides professional mobile car repair across all areas of Dubai, sending an experienced mechanic directly to your vehicle's location—whether parked in a residential driveway, apartment or villa parking area, office parking facility, commercial building, shopping centre car park, or a suitable roadside location. When you contact our team, we discuss the symptoms and parking access to determine whether the issue can be safely diagnosed and resolved on-site or if workshop repair is necessary.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            For on-site repairs, our technicians travel with portable OBD-II multi-system diagnostic scanners, digital battery testers, heavy-duty jump packs, and trade hand tools. Common on-site services include <a href="/car-battery-replacement-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car battery replacement</a>, emergency jump starts, computer fault scanning, <a href="/tyre-replacement-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">tyre puncture repair</a>, and on-site <a href="/engine-oil-change-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">engine oil changes</a>. If our initial inspection reveals deeper mechanical concerns—such as worn brake pads, transmission faults, cooling leaks, or internal engine problems—we advise you transparently and can coordinate vehicle transfer to our 222 Al Satwa Road garage for comprehensive <a href="/car-engine-service-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car engine service</a>, specialized cooling care, or <a href="/car-maintenance-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">scheduled car maintenance</a>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            Our mobile mechanics serve motorists throughout Dubai seven days a week, from 7:00 AM to 10:00 PM. Before dispatching a mechanic, we explain the applicable call-out fee—starting from AED 30 for eligible central Dubai neighbourhoods—and discuss initial pricing so you know what to expect. If your vehicle is disabled on the road or requires flatbed towing, our dedicated <a href="/roadside-assistance-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">roadside assistance in Dubai</a> is ready to help. To request on-site assistance or confirm availability for your neighbourhood, simply call our workshop or share your location via WhatsApp.
                        </p>

                        <div class="dcrs-action-row">
                            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Mechanic
                            </a>
                            <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Location
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="dcrs-intro-visual">
                        <div class="dcrs-photo-card">
                            <img
                                src={service7Image.src}
                                alt="Technician conducting on-site mobile car repair in Dubai with mobile workshop equipment"
                                width="600"
                                height="400"
                                loading="eager"
                                class="dcrs-photo-card__img"
                            />
                            <div class="dcrs-photo-badge">
                                <div class="dcrs-photo-badge__value">AED 30</div>
                                <div class="dcrs-photo-badge__label">Call-Out Fee From</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. PRICING AND COST FACTORS -------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="pricing">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Fast and Affordable Pricing</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Mobile Car Repair Pricing &amp; Service Rates in Dubai</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Transparent call-out rates and competitive service pricing. You approve a clear written quote on-site before any repair work starts.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-onsite-grid">
                    {onsiteServices.map((s) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-onsite-card">
                            <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__header">
                                <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__icon">
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons[s.icon]} />
                                </div>
                                <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__meta">
                                    <h3 class="dcrs-onsite-card__title">{s.title}</h3>
                                    <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__tags">
                                        <span class="dcrs-onsite-card__price">{s.price}</span>
                                        {s.mobileScope === 'yes' ? (
                                            <span class="dcrs-tag dcrs-tag--success">✓ Fully Mobile</span>
                                        ) : (
                                            <span class="dcrs-tag dcrs-tag--warning">Partial On-Site</span>
                                        )}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="dcrs-onsite-card__desc">{s.desc}</p>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>

                <p class="dcrs-pricing-disclaimer">
                    <Fragment set:html={icons.infoCircle} /> Note: Call-out fees start from AED 30 in eligible central Dubai areas (Al Satwa, Jumeirah, Downtown, Business Bay) and vary for outer communities across Dubai. Call-out fees cover technician dispatch and travel. Diagnostic testing, labour, and replacement parts (such as batteries, oil, and filters) are quoted with transparent itemisation for your approval before any work begins.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. SERVICE PROCESS ----------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="how-it-works">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">How It Works</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Our 4-Step On-Site Service Workflow</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        From your first call or WhatsApp pin to completed repair and testing - simple, clear, and professional across Dubai.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-steps-grid">
                    {steps.map((st) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-step-card">
                            <span class="dcrs-step-card__num">{st.num}</span>
                            <h3 class="dcrs-step-card__title">{st.title}</h3>
                            <p class="dcrs-step-card__desc">{st.desc}</p>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. CAPABILITIES & BOUNDARIES ------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="capabilities">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Capabilities &amp; Boundaries</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">On-Site Services vs. Workshop Interventions</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        We believe in complete mechanical honesty. Here is what we handle on-site and what requires workshop lifting.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-workshop-box">
                    <div class="dcrs-workshop-box__header">
                        <span class="dcrs-workshop-box__icon">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.alert} />
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="dcrs-workshop-box__title">
                            Repairs Requiring Our Al Satwa Workshop - Honest Advice First
                        </h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="dcrs-workshop-box__lead">
                        Certain complex automotive repairs cannot be carried out safely or reliably in a parking bay or at the roadside without hydraulic vehicle hoists, heavy pressing machinery, and specialist workshop tooling. Attempting complex structural, gearbox, or internal engine repairs roadside compromises vehicle safety. Our mechanic first assesses the issue on-site; if workshop intervention is necessary, we explain the technical reasons clearly and coordinate vehicle transfer to our Al Satwa facility with your approval.
                    </p>
                    <div class="dcrs-workshop-list">
                        {workshopRepairs.map((w) => (
                            <div class="dcrs-workshop-item">
                                <span class="dcrs-workshop-item__arrow">
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
                                </span>
                                <span>{w}</span>
                            </div>
                        ))}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. COVERAGE & SERVICE LOCATIONS ---------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="coverage">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Dubai-Wide Service Coverage</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Mobile Car Repair Service Areas Across Dubai</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Our mobile mechanics provide on-site vehicle repair, diagnostics, and battery assistance across all residential communities, business districts, and parking areas in Dubai.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-location-groups">
                    {locationGroups.map((group) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-location-group-card">
                            <div class="dcrs-location-group-head">
                                <div class="dcrs-location-group-title-wrap">
                                    <span class="dcrs-location-group-icon">
                                        <Fragment set:html={icons.mapPin} />
                                    </span>
                                    <h3 class="dcrs-location-group-title">{group.title}</h3>
                                </div>
                                <span class="dcrs-location-badge">{group.badge}</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="dcrs-location-group-desc">{group.desc}</p>
                            <div class="dcrs-location-chips">
                                {group.areas.map((area) => (
                                    <span class="dcrs-location-chip">
                                        <span class="dcrs-location-chip-check">
                                            <Fragment set:html={icons.check} />
                                        </span>
                                        {area}
                                    </span>
                                ))}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-location-callout">
                    <div class="dcrs-location-callout__copy">
                        <h4 class="dcrs-location-callout__title">On-Site Assistance Wherever You Are in Dubai</h4>
                        <p class="dcrs-location-callout__text">
                            Our mobile mechanics cover residential, commercial and business locations throughout Dubai. Whether your vehicle is parked at home, at work or in a suitable roadside location, contact our team and share your location to arrange assistance.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dcrs-location-callout__actions">
                        <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Mechanic
                        </a>
                        <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> Share WhatsApp Location
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 7. WHY CHOOSE DUBAI CAR REPAIR SERVICE? -------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="why-choose-us">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Why Choose Us</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Why Dubai Drivers Trust Our Mobile Mechanics</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">12+ years of independent workshop experience, qualified mechanics, and transparent pricing.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-why-grid">
                    {whyChooseUs.map((r) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-why-card">
                            <span class="dcrs-why-card__icon">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons[r.icon]} />
                            </span>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="dcrs-why-card__title">{r.title}</h3>
                                <p class="dcrs-why-card__desc">{r.desc}</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 8. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ) ----------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="faq">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">FAQ</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Mobile Car Repair Dubai - Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-faq-accordion">
                    {faqs.map((faq, i) => (
                        <details class="dcrs-faq-item" open={i === 0}>
                            <summary class="dcrs-faq-item__question">
                                <span>{faq.q}</span>
                                <span class="dcrs-faq-item__toggle">
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons.chevronDown} />
                                </span>
                            </summary>
                            <div class="dcrs-faq-item__answer">
                                <p>{faq.a}</p>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 9. RELATED SERVICES ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="related-services">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">More Services</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Related Services You May Need</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-related-grid">
                    {relatedServices.map((r) => (
                        <a href={r.href} class="dcrs-related-card">
                            <span class="dcrs-related-card__icon">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons[r.icon]} />
                            </span>
                            <h3 class="dcrs-related-card__title">{r.name}</h3>
                            <p class="dcrs-related-card__desc">{r.desc}</p>
                        </a>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 10. FINAL CTA ---------------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-cta-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-cta-banner__inner">
                    <div class="dcrs-cta-banner__copy">
                        <span class="dcrs-cta-banner__badge">Dubai-Wide Mobile Service · Physical Workshop at 222 Al Satwa Road</span>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-cta-banner__title">
                            Book Mobile Car Repair Anywhere in Dubai
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-cta-banner__sub">
                            Need a mechanic at your location? Contact Dubai Car Repair Service for mobile car repair across Dubai. Share your vehicle details and location to confirm the required service, applicable call-out charges and estimated arrival time. Our Al Satwa workshop is also available for extensive mechanical repairs.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dcrs-cta-banner__actions">
                        <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                        </a>
                        <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 11. BOTTOM STICKY MOBILE BAR ------------------------------------>
        <div class="dcrs-stickybar">
            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid dcrs-stickybar__btn">
                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Now
            </a>
            <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid dcrs-stickybar__btn dcrs-stickybar__btn--wa">
                <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp
            </a>
        </div>

    </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    :root {
        --ink: #10201F;
        --ink-soft: #1B302E;
        --paper: #FAF8F5;
        --paper-alt: #f1f3f5;
        --white: #FFFFFF;
        --brass: #D48E33;
        --brass-deep: #9C6423;
        --steel: #444444;
        --rule-on-paper: rgba(16, 32, 31, 0.12);
        --rule-on-ink: rgba(251, 249, 244, 0.16);
    }

    .dcrs-service-page {
        padding-bottom: 0;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        overflow-x: clip;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        background-color: var(--paper, #FAF8F5);
        color: var(--ink, #10201F);
    }

    @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
        :global(.float) {
            display: none !important;
        }
    }

    .dcrs-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1180px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.25rem;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .dcrs-container {
            padding: 0 0.85rem;
        }
    }

    /* Kicker & Typography */
    .dcrs-kicker {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--brass-deep);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        background: rgba(193, 128, 46, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(193, 128, 46, 0.25);
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .dcrs-heading {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .dcrs-heading--center {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 680px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
    }

    .dcrs-heading__title {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 4.2vw, 2.35rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-heading__sub {
        color: #666;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-lead-text {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-body-text {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #555;
        margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-inline-link {
        color: var(--brass-deep);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }

    /* Section Wrappers */
    .dcrs-section {
        padding: clamp(3rem, 6.5vw, 5rem) 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .dcrs-section--paper { background: var(--paper, #FAF8F5); }
    .dcrs-section--tint { background: #f7f9fa; border-top: 1px solid #eef1f3; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef1f3; }

    /* Buttons */
    .dcrs-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.55rem;
        font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        text-decoration: none;
        line-height: 1;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
        min-height: 48px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .dcrs-btn :global(svg) {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .dcrs-btn--solid {
        background: var(--brass);
        color: var(--ink) !important;
    }
    .dcrs-btn--solid:hover {
        background: var(--brass-deep);
        color: #fff !important;
    }

    .dcrs-btn--wa {
        background: #25d366;
        color: #fff !important;
    }
    .dcrs-btn--wa:hover {
        background: #1ebc59;
    }

    .dcrs-action-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.85rem;
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    /* 1. Hero Banner */
    .dcrs-hero-banner {
        position: relative;
        background-color: var(--ink);
        color: #FBF9F4;
        padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem) 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 500px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
        .dcrs-hero-banner {
            min-height: auto;
            padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4rem) 0;
        }
    }

    .dcrs-hero-banner .dcrs-container {
        width: 100%;
    }

    .dcrs-hero-banner__scrim {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(193, 128, 46, 0.15), transparent 50%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .dcrs-hero-banner__inner {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 820px;
    }

    .dcrs-breadcrumb ol {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
